WEBVTT

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:01.467
Here's one,

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:03.433
a number series!

00:00:03.433 --> 00:00:04.100
One,

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:04.733
five,

00:00:04.733 --> 00:00:05.400
eleven,

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:06.067
nineteen,

00:00:06.067 --> 00:00:06.733
twenty-nine,

00:00:06.733 --> 00:00:08.033
and then...

00:00:08.033 --> 00:00:10.000
what comes next?

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:10.667
A.

00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:11.333
Forty-three,

00:00:11.333 --> 00:00:12.000
B.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:12.633
Thirty-one,

00:00:12.633 --> 00:00:13.300
C.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:13.967
Forty-one,

00:00:13.967 --> 00:00:15.267
or D.

00:00:15.267 --> 00:00:15.933
Forty-four?

00:00:15.933 --> 00:00:17.267
Five seconds!

00:00:22.633 --> 00:00:23.700
TIME'S UP!

00:00:24.133 --> 00:00:25.433
The answer is...

00:00:25.433 --> 00:00:25.867
C,

00:00:25.867 --> 00:00:26.300
forty-one!

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:28.933
The gaps grow by the same

00:00:28.933 --> 00:00:30.233
amount each step,

00:00:30.233 --> 00:00:32.867
so the next number is forty-one.

00:00:33.367 --> 00:00:33.767
So...

00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:35.667
are you a smart fella,

00:00:35.667 --> 00:00:37.200
or a fart smella?
